OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly mist and fog patches will
OL,6,Fgradually clear by mid-morning to
OL,7,Fleave a fine and dry day, with
OL,8,Fvariable amounts of cloud and sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling very warm for early
OL,10,FOctober, with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying dry with variable
OL,13,Fcloud and lengthy clear spells for
OL,14,Fmany. Under the clearest skies some
OL,15,Fmist and fog patches are likely to re-
OL,16,Fform overnight. Cool. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
