OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fwill gradually clear by mid-morning to
OL,7,Fgive another fine day, with variable
OL,8,Fcloud and bright or sunny spells.
OL,9,FTemperatures still above average.
OL,10,FLight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloud
OL,13,Fand rain, locally heavy, gradually
OL,14,Fclearing southeast Wednesday. Mostly
OL,15,Fdry with sunny spells Thursday, after
OL,16,Fa chilly start. Breezier, with rain
OL,17,Fspreading east Friday. Temperatures
OL,18,Fnearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
